    "溫和提醒模式（自動停、省電）" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Gentle Reminder mode (auto-stop, battery-friendly)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "溫和提醒模式（自動停、省電）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "用通知響一下就自動停、不會一直響到沒電；可突破專注模式，但破不了實體靜音，較不會吵醒熟睡的孩子。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Rings once via a notification, then auto-stops — it won't keep ringing until the battery dies. Cuts through Focus, but not the physical silent switch, so it's less likely to wake a deeply sleeping child."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "用通知響一下就自動停、不會一直響到沒電；可突破專注模式，但破不了實體靜音，較不會吵醒熟睡的孩子。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "用通知響一次（≤30 秒）就自動停，不會一直響到沒電。可突破專注模式，但破不了實體靜音，較不會吵醒熟睡的孩子。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Rings once as a notification (up to 30 sec), then stops on its own — it never rings until the battery dies. Breaks through Focus mode, but not the silent switch, so it's gentler on a sleeping child."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "用通知響一次（≤30 秒）就自動停，不會一直響到沒電。可突破專注模式，但破不了實體靜音，較不會吵醒熟睡的孩子。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
