    "開啟床邊模式" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Turn on bedside mode"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "開啟床邊模式"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "開啟後，App 在前台時保持麥克風（橘點亮），可說「我起床了」關鬧鐘。切到背景或螢幕關閉會自動停止麥克風，不整夜佔用；此時鬧鐘改由系統通知橫幅發出鈴聲。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When on, the app keeps the mic active in the foreground (orange dot). Say 'I'm awake' to stop the alarm. The mic stops automatically when the screen locks or app backgrounds — it won't run all night."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "開啟後，應用程式在前台時保持麥克風（橘點亮），可說「我起床了」關鬧鐘。切到背景或螢幕關閉會自動停止麥克風，不整夜佔用；此時鬧鐘改由系統通知橫幅發出鈴聲。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "開啟後，App 在畫面最前台時保持麥克風（橘點亮），說「我起床了」就能關鬧鐘。切到背景或螢幕關閉，麥克風會自動停止，不會整夜佔用。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When on, the app keeps the mic open (orange dot) while in the foreground — say \"I'm awake\" to dismiss the alarm. The mic stops automatically when backgrounded or the screen turns off."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "開啟後，應用程式在畫面最前台時保持麥克風（橘點亮），說「我起床了」就能關鬧鐘。切到背景或螢幕關閉，麥克風會自動停止，不會整夜佔用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "開啟後，App 會在背景持續開著麥克風（螢幕上方橘點長亮），讓小孩在關螢幕/鎖屏時也能用聲音關鬧鐘。較耗電，且整夜使用麥克風——確定需要再開。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Voice \"I'm awake\" only works inside the in-app wake screen (foreground). While the system alarm is ringing it holds the microphone, so the alarm can't be voice-stopped in the background or from the banner — use the ✕ to dismiss. The mic stays off while the system alarm handles alarms, to save battery."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "聲控「我起床了」只在打開應用程式的起床畫面（前景）才有效。系統鬧鐘響鈴時會佔用麥克風，無法在背景或橫幅通知上用聲音關鬧鐘，請按 ✕ 關閉。系統鬧鐘啟用時本功能不會開啟麥克風，以節省電力。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
